{"event_type":"review","id":"ce37ab1db8c81763b386153a90a03e6e2cb196c092c8557ad9fdc330c2fec82b","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T12:47:58Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f76a1e5f25a2c64d7937038d19474e78badb561700d6fc963f8fb1bdd4a5af6d","sha256":"f76a1e5f25a2c64d7937038d19474e78badb561700d6fc963f8fb1bdd4a5af6d"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/66670c04fe98b191f3cea056aa60694152ef281df388eb6ae8ad532e4ac3be72","sha256":"66670c04fe98b191f3cea056aa60694152ef281df388eb6ae8ad532e4ac3be72"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e3886732137e3d7bfa74ca160ec56931588bf90dbf8f3af8eef31ef6bdc819d2","sha256":"e3886732137e3d7bfa74ca160ec56931588bf90dbf8f3af8eef31ef6bdc819d2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e6355a4e7953449c3f35bbf2692b87f5c35cfafdde490cf1be0d0a6fbe949e02","sha256":"e6355a4e7953449c3f35bbf2692b87f5c35cfafdde490cf1be0d0a6fbe949e02"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/24f906d0e739fb8bcfc1dda3ffe20cecd3ff615684c1c1f001f2dd593de1a041","sha256":"24f906d0e739fb8bcfc1dda3ffe20cecd3ff615684c1c1f001f2dd593de1a041"}],"attempt_id":"46f4c7e09adad2171502664f98fe0f87a13991d825639083e033072a4e8681d1:0:1","base":"b3e9e18a891dc4641b82d6d16dffff4ade55923d","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"0b089dc67efeea58d0784dcbbe446021ab5df3d2","body":"**Reject `automationLogin` in the same-account path (`src/ops/merge/classifyPrs.ts:352-362`).**\n\n`isTrustedReviewer` never trusts `ctx.config.automationLogin`. The `ClassifyPrConfig` doc says \"it is never trusted\". `hasSameAccountAgentAcceptance` checks only `STRUCTURAL_EXCLUDED` and `excludedLogins`.\n\nAssume the automation account is a machine user with `authorType === 'User'` and an `OWNER`, `MEMBER` or `COLLABORATOR` association. If that account opens a PR and posts a marked `PASS` review, it passes every check here. Row 7 then accepts it, although the config says this identity is never trusted.\n\nAdd an `automationLogin` check beside the other exclusions.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n   const login = latest.authorLogin.toLowerCase();\n   const normalizedLogin = attestationLogin(login);\n+  if (\n+    ctx.config.automationLogin != null &&\n+    attestationLogin(ctx.config.automationLogin) === normalizedLogin\n+  )\n+    return false;\n   if ([...STRUCTURAL_EXCLUDED].some((excluded) => attestationLogin(excluded) === normalizedLogin))\n     return false;\n```\n</details>\n\nAs per the `ClassifyPrConfig.automationLogin` doc in `classify.config.ts:92`, this is the \"Automation identity; it is never trusted\".","id":"dcde095382da86b7de0c38e09218e51a7f0dbca180a58f6ae2a8821c3b3fde57","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/merge/classifyPrs.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Reject `automationLogin` in the same-account path (`src/ops/merge/classifyPrs.ts:352-362`)."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"fc6c0d91d145aeb3cc736b4e305bf33682a642f4","body":"**Sync the template before this workflow is re-instantiated.**\n\n`.github/workflows/cq-accept.yml` says it is instantiated from `policy/templates/cq-accept.yml` and must be edited only through the template. The checked-out instance has changes the template does not carry:\n\n- The `on:` block drops the `pull_request` trigger.\n- The `main-advisory` job is removed.\n- The `judge` job drops `continue-on-error: true`.\n- Target lookups and the `--base` argument change from `main` to `merge-queue`, including the `resolve` lookups and the `judge` invocation of `acceptance.js`.\n- The `resolve` job's `if:` drops the `pull_request` branch.\n- The `judge` env block adds `CQ_MERGE_ALLOW_SAME_ACCOUNT_AGENT_REVIEW`.\n- The check-run `conclusion` changes from `\"neutral\"` to `\"success\"` or `\"failure\"` (around lines 396-403).\n\nThe template still has the main-direct design. A re-instantiation from the template would restore the `pull_request` trigger and the `main` base, and it would revert the merge-queue gating. Port these changes into `policy/templates/cq-accept.yml`, then re-instantiate. Do not edit the instance directly.","id":"5db01a462832ae1928f6e948f792c1622a6dc1b2eb47db9573b5bc283f00fb8c","intervals":[],"path":".github/workflows/cq-accept.yml","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Sync the template before this workflow is re-instantiated."}],"head":"28537ae52be0b9f845d8bf18949d16e466efa263","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"fc6c0d91d145aeb3cc736b4e305bf33682a642f4","intervals":[[5,8],[16,19],[81,86],[145,154],[158,158],[289,289],[312,316],[326,327]],"path":".github/workflows/cq-accept.yml"},{"blob":"8681658e1ee0afbafbec661cd6979fe9cb9cce78","intervals":[[12,12],[17,41],[49,49],[75,75],[105,110],[134,135],[137,137],[141,145],[150,150],[152,152],[154,163],[171,204],[208,211],[219,219],[229,229],[235,241]],"path":".github/workflows/self-merge-prs.yml"},{"blob":"84b62b7af8e9081f487998bc4747d3a5b9d327de","intervals":[[104,105]],"path":"src/ops/merge/classify.config.ts"},{"blob":"0b089dc67efeea58d0784dcbbe446021ab5df3d2","intervals":[[76,76],[299,365],[520,522]],"path":"src/ops/merge/classifyPrs.ts"},{"blob":"5bdceb7d437fe6959ea84ee40ac132fdecbc9623","intervals":[[165,165],[484,484],[509,517],[532,540]],"path":"src/ops/merge/registry.ts"},{"blob":"49ac385356e792290dbcf8af1b1e239140fbae01","intervals":[[84,86],[95,96],[154,154],[190,196],[234,235],[610,627],[630,635],[645,653],[675,687]],"path":"src/ops/merge/runPrs.ts"},{"blob":"9a65751a0f2a700cbd80010fa4bf81d31e793ca5","intervals":[[14,15],[17,21],[28,33],[36,36],[42,43],[52,61],[74,74],[88,88],[128,128],[158,161],[166,166],[174,176],[182,182],[205,206],[252,252],[270,271],[302,303],[308,313],[321,325],[363,363],[366,375]